{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-108","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：截差无理线段与中项无理线段与无理线段","englishTitle":"If from a rational area a medial area be subtracted, the side of the remaining area becomes one of two irrational straight lines, either an apotome or a minor straight line.","book":10,"number":108,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.108","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.108/","group":"prop_3","sourceNumber":108,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-108@raw-cd26ad17cd5478cc","contentId":"euclid-10-108","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cd26ad17cd5478cc1fb37b6ffd501ceb56e1fa1a58cdd6325956e22212aaaf4f","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-108.statement","euclid-10-108.proof.1","euclid-10-108.construction.1","euclid-10-108.proof.2","euclid-10-108.proof.3","euclid-10-108.proof.4","euclid-10-108.proof.5","euclid-10-108.proof.6","euclid-10-108.proof.7","euclid-10-108.proof.8","euclid-10-108.proof.9","euclid-10-108.proof.10","euclid-10-108.conclusion","euclid-10-108.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-108.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-108","revisionId":"euclid-10-108@raw-cd26ad17cd5478cc","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"946325c1d60e6e8d5d4dbb40a6ce25a96231d8560329051792281bdf3db0a527","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If from a rational area a medial area be subtracted, the side of the remaining area becomes one of two irrational straight lines, either an apotome or a minor straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果从有理面积个区域减去中项无理线段个区域,则剩余区域一侧成为两个无理线段个区域之一,即截差无理线段个区域或一条小直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-108.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-108","revisionId":"euclid-10-108@raw-cd26ad17cd5478cc","order":1,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a79806f6a9f6fbba1a3cc22c5f1048b4961d96c73b1d4fd868e80415273cbf46","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For from the rational area BC let the medial area BD be subtracted; I say that the side of the remainder EC becomes one of two irrational straight lines, either an apotome or a minor straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从有理面积 BC区域中减去中项无理线段区域BD;我说,其余EC区域成为两条无理线段区域之一,要么是截差无理线段,要么是一条小直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-108.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-108","revisionId":"euclid-10-108@raw-cd26ad17cd5478cc","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"77b9842244876760c04c2068517326d0fbb0be024ca4d96e3d589c659ee19118","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let a rational straight line FG be set out, to FG let there be applied the rectangular parallelogram GH equal to BC, and let GK equal to DB be subtracted; therefore the remainder EC is equal to LH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将有理线段 FG数字改为FG,将平行四边形 GH方形等于BC,将GK等于DB数字减去,因此,其余EC数字等于LH。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-108.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-108","revisionId":"euclid-10-108@raw-cd26ad17cd5478cc","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c55af8102a6325bca31ba478f18cfbc941b61d324d1cdcc63513e7db0574bfaa","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then BC is rational, and BD medial, while BC is equal to GH, and BD to GK, therefore GH is rational, and GK medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"自那时以来,BC为有理,BD 中项无理线段,BC等于GH,BD等于GK,因此,GH等于有理,GK 中项无理线段等于GK。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-108.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-108","revisionId":"euclid-10-108@raw-cd26ad17cd5478cc","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9d3c28bd7fe4840524ab6903ece43c0aa9e8e81ac425195e1d730538c1339646","citations":["euclid-10-20","euclid-10-22","euclid-10-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And they are applied to the rational straight line FG; therefore FH is rational and commensurable in length with FG, [[X. 20](/principles/euclid-10-20)] while FK is rational and incommensurable in length with FG; [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)] therefore FH is incommensurable in length with FK. [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"适用于有理线段 FG;因此,FH为有理和长度可公度为FG,FK为有理和不可公度为FG;因此,FH为不可公度为FK,FK为FK。 [[X. 20](/principles/euclid-10-20)] [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)] [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-108.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-108","revisionId":"euclid-10-108@raw-cd26ad17cd5478cc","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1bdc44f1a8d57d0410652cf49d9d78bd89e7e503c61463f0836d40b86e9247b9","citations":["euclid-10-73"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore FH, FK are rational straight lines commensurable in square only; therefore KH is an apotome [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)], and KF the annex to it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,FH,FK是有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度;KH是截差无理线段,KF是附件。 [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-108.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-108","revisionId":"euclid-10-108@raw-cd26ad17cd5478cc","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5f254fb9fe87fd7d75cb35134a75411c5296d7b7a4617557416a0df1f49fdaee","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now the square on HF is greater than the square on FK by the square on a straight line either commensurable with HF or not commensurable."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在HF的正方形比FK的正方形 高出可公度的正方形 要么是HF线,要么不是可公度"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-108.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-108","revisionId":"euclid-10-108@raw-cd26ad17cd5478cc","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ffdb2736bc32752dad59b905181d33552794c056db6647840ffdf4785f6cf6c8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"First, let the square on it be greater by the square on a straight line commensurable with it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"首先,正方形机在正方形上 和可公度上再加一"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-108.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-108","revisionId":"euclid-10-108@raw-cd26ad17cd5478cc","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2cf1664b4239c0a90d1cc477a105154671c679bfe3fd8c43a859176f7a3b014e","citations":["euclid-10-def-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now the whole HF is commensurable in length with the rational straight line FG set out; therefore KH is a first apotome. [[X. Deff. III. 1](/principles/euclid-10-def-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,整个HF是长度可公度,有理线段FG已经确定,因此,KH是第一个截差无理线段。 [[X. Deff. III. 1](/principles/euclid-10-def-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-108.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-108","revisionId":"euclid-10-108@raw-cd26ad17cd5478cc","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"66d048d98236d9780844582549850aab3d692804a365860fc0d25306cd84d988","citations":["euclid-10-91"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the side of the rectangle contained by a rational straight line and a first apotome is an apotome. [[X. 91](/principles/euclid-10-91)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但矩形的一面是有理线段 头截差无理线段是截差无理线段 [[X. 91](/principles/euclid-10-91)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-108.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-108","revisionId":"euclid-10-108@raw-cd26ad17cd5478cc","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cf7481b57ac60978a9098b8f8acc6d9088c14fd044ede61a91056aaf48cf11b3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the side of LH, that is, of EC, is an apotome."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,LH,即EC的一面是截差无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-108.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-108","revisionId":"euclid-10-108@raw-cd26ad17cd5478cc","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9c27ece9af8cd571e8224164c0f1e4323d5bb424eb7e52892930e1d2f5a8a0d0","citations":["euclid-10-def-14"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, if the square on HF is greater than the square on FK by the square on a straight line incommensurable with HF, while the whole FH is commensurable in length with the rational straight line FG set out, KH is a fourth apotome. [[X. Deff. III. 4](/principles/euclid-10-def-14)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,如果HF上的正方形比FK上的正方形大,不可公度直线上正方形直线上HF直线上不可公度,而整个FH全线是长度可公度,有理线段 FG设定,KH是第四截差无理线段。 [[X. Deff. III. 4](/principles/euclid-10-def-14)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-108.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-108","revisionId":"euclid-10-108@raw-cd26ad17cd5478cc","order":12,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e70c6b062216f8dbbdf14b7682ffa72bb8ff54a58892232f1884e06ef51b9439","citations":["euclid-10-94"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the side of the rectangle contained by a rational straight line and a fourth apotome is minor. [[X. 94](/principles/euclid-10-94)] Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但由有理线段和第四截差无理线段组成的矩形船的一侧是次要的。 证毕。 [[X. 94](/principles/euclid-10-94)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-108.source","contentId":"euclid-10-108","revisionId":"euclid-10-108@raw-cd26ad17cd5478cc","order":13,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"caecb0d8d075ce6edb9b69c7805185926ebc69e0474400d3bcab1e807abc1396","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.108/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.108\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-108:euclid-10-20:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-108","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-108.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-20","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis